815d0c4e00942f93cae199e","session_date":"2023-06-21","session_datetime":"2023-06-21T15:15:00","session_id":"session_9","session_index":9,"source_sha256":"1b2e45e583ee04a93a293d5552b23a22628be9be1d49745fdfff25ce71b760e1","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":20}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Thanks, Dave! Excited to drive again. Appreciate your help! Look what a wonderful view from living room!\n[Image caption: a photo of a view of a small town with a mountain in the background]\n[S9T11] (dia_id: D9:11)\n\nDave: Wow, what an amazing view! Where is it? I haven't seen anything like that before!\n[S9T12] (dia_id: D9:12)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It's from a small town in Japan. The view of the mountains is unbelievably stunning!\n[S9T13] (dia_id: D9:13)\n\nDave: Wow! Did you get to that place yet?\n[S9T14] (dia_id: D9:14)\n\nCalvin: Nope, not yet! I haven't been there before, but it's on my to-do list for after my tour with Frank Ocean ends. Can't wait to see them in person! Look at that snowy peak.\n[Image caption: a photo of a person on skis on a snowy mountain]\n[S9T15] (dia_id: D9:15)\n\nDave: Looks awesome! Have you ever tried skiing before? It looks like loads of fun!\n[S9T16] (dia_id: D9:16)\n\nCalvin: Haven't tried it before, but it does look like a lot of fun! I might give it a try once. So what's up with you, is anything new in your daily routine?\n[S9T17] (dia_id: D9:17)\n\nDave: Yes, Cal! I recently joined a rock band and have been practicing guitar. Look at this photo – it's us, the guys! \n[Image caption: a photography of a group of men playing instruments in a room]\n[S9T18] (dia_id: D9:18)\n\nCalvin: Playing guitar in a rock band is awesome, Dave! It will bring you a lot of emotions.\n[S9T19] (dia_id: D9:19)\n\nDave: Sounds good, Calvin! Good company and great music, lift the mood and bring a lot of positive emotions! I have to go now. I'll see you soon!\n[S9T20] (dia_id: D9:20)","text_sha256":"2e3101ff7e4e622b8854593e70d8f73319809dbcc69d20bd73ba44e3c0c68e7a","timestamp":"2023-06-21T15:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D8:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":21,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S8T3]"],"text_sha256":"cea925a109268e3f72a097ae22c4a5d679bcf3bb9546c4d534349894ed852e09"},{"dia_ids":["D8:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":24,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S8T4]"],"text_sha256":"2521a9c8b8cd2ffc14061a3f971ea457be3c59f50cc711376679d950bf8c1c4b"},{"dia_ids":["D8:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":26,"source_locators":["[S8T5]"],"text_sha256":"a38ef567494f8467429f6d434e64df7b24c87c7ae8d5a25541021f6c31268ec6"},{"dia_ids":["D8:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":31,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S8T6]"],"text_sha256":"12c035f9b5250f04af87092929de100879407b682b5f59a8bf0c2b858858e1c5"},{"dia_ids":["D8:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":35,"line_start":33,"source_locators":["[S8T7]"],"text_sha256":"c8b75195f504c68c5835de629c07e187554a5994ffb41ae662bc35fa268bcf6c"},{"dia_ids":["D8:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":38,"line_start":37,"source_locators":["[S8T8]"],"text_sha256":"210b48f0d2259062f7a240533af9de2a579c676d793ea6a01b186fd76d2e8da1"},{"dia_ids":["D8:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":42,"line_start":40,"source_locators":["[S8T9]"],"text_sha256":"4d3eda8c4b12451b48468341e1eab4ea2d422ca203b12730991da9a8fc91b90f"},{"dia_ids":["D8:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":45,"line_start":44,"source_locators":["[S8T10]"],"text_sha256":"b8d2e0abb61052d51846c52302b99b8099f1b68d279e8eba0642376becd33547"},{"dia_ids":["D8:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":48,"line_start":47,"source_locators":["[S8T11]"],"text_sha256":"4e9ff3e5ffc1e7752d6cce124faee6ededaef0540bbd8df0ee05abf429a87cf9"},{"dia_ids":["D8:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":51,"line_start":50,"source_locators":["[S8T12]"],"text_sha256":"d6d281ba3af048